18
00:00:45,880 --> 00:00:48,420
Yet the historical record points the other way.

19
00:00:49,260 --> 00:00:50,200
That sounds bullish.

20
00:00:51,080 --> 00:00:54,330
But the real signal in twenty twenty-six may not be

