59
00:02:47,640 --> 00:02:50,740
The Stock Trader's Almanac had called the broader

60
00:02:50,740 --> 00:02:53,840
season the market's Sweet Spot. TradeWave let me

61
00:02:53,840 --> 00:02:57,328
narrow it to exact dates and see what happened

62
00:02:57,328 --> 00:03:00,040
