75
00:03:37,820 --> 00:03:41,732
The final return shows the destination. MFE and MAE

76
00:03:41,732 --> 00:03:44,340
show what happened on the road.

77
00:03:45,060 --> 00:03:48,409
In twenty eighteen, the market fell nineteen point

78
00:03:48,409 --> 00:03:50,920
five percent below its starting price.

79
00:03:51,940 --> 00:03:54,694
Then it recovered and finished up two point eight

80
00:03:54,694 --> 00:03:55,000
