82
00:04:00,074 --> 00:04:00,880
frightening decline.

83
00:04:01,840 --> 00:04:03,700
Then there is nineteen thirty.

84
00:04:04,620 --> 00:04:07,956
The worst point was more than thirty-five percent

85
00:04:07,956 --> 00:04:11,292
